<p data-imt-p=3D"1">Once the system has booted, enter the following command=
s in the serial terminal to configure the ANTSDR E310 as a WiFi router.<fon=
t class=3D"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper" lang=3D"zh-CN" d=
ata-imt-deferred-display=3D"" style=3D"display: none;"><br><font class=3D"n=
