 =E9=85=8D=E7=BD=AE=E4=B8=BA WiFi =E8=B7=AF=E7=94=B1=E5=99=A8=E3=80=82</fon=
t></font></font></p>
<div class=3D"highlight-default notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre>=
<span></span><span class=3D"o">./</span><span class=3D"n">openwifi</span><s=
